// "This is a list of allowed tags. It's the list of (registered / autoloaded) function-, block and filter plugins that should be accessible to the template.\n                                If empty, no restriction by allowed_tags. This may be needed for custom templates" => "This is a list of allowed tags. It's the list of (registered / autoloaded) function-, block and filter plugins that should be accessible to the template.\n                                If empty, no restriction by allowed_tags. This may be needed for custom templates",
// "This is a list of disabled tags. It's the list of (registered / autoloaded) function-, block and filter plugins that may not be accessible to the template.\n                                If empty, no restriction by disabled_tags. This may be needed for custom templates" => "This is a list of disabled tags. It's the list of (registered / autoloaded) function-, block and filter plugins that may not be accessible to the template.\n                                If empty, no restriction by disabled_tags. This may be needed for custom templates",
// "This is the list of allowed modifier plugins. It's the array of (registered / autoloaded) modifiers that should be accessible to the template.\n                                If this array is non-empty, only the herein listed modifiers may be used. This is a whitelist. If empty, no restriction by allowed_modifiers. This may be needed for custom templates" => "This is the list of allowed modifier plugins. It's the array of (registered / autoloaded) modifiers that should be accessible to the template.\n                                If this array is non-empty, only the herein listed modifiers may be used. This is a whitelist. If empty, no restriction by allowed_modifiers. This may be needed for custom templates",
